  "ingredients": [
    "1 teaspoon sea salt",
    "1 teaspoon ground black pepper",
    "1 teaspoon ground cumin",
    "1 teaspoon paprika",
    "1 teaspoon Italian seasoning",
    "1 teaspoon garlic powder",
    "3 skinless, boneless chicken breast halves",
    "1 (10.75 ounce) can cream of mushroom soup",
    "6 ounces Italian salad dressing",
    "0.5 cup grated Parmesan cheese",
    "0.25 cup all-purpose flour",
    "2 teaspoons malt vinegar",
    "0.66666668653488 cup sour cream",
    "1 (8 ounce) package angel hair pasta"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/UhemJa9s8WZxMgtZzChz01gYanc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/236727-melt-in-your-mouth-slow-cooker-chicken-VAT-step-01-c46cc5be2a314dcaab2c45228def7f8a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/236727/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk sea salt, black pepper, cumin, paprika, Italian seasoning, and garlic powder together in a bowl. Season chicken breasts with seasoning mixture; place in the slow cooker.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/SFtka4UuyH-fIYZxpB-XYrsl1a8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/236727-melt-in-your-mouth-slow-cooker-chicken-VAT-step-02-1b3ade920328459ab1220933a45dfc67.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/236727/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir cream of mushroom soup, Italian dressing, Parmesan cheese, flour, and vinegar together in a bowl; pour over chicken.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Z0R_JKvzCnb2TLtkxyqHS78GZF8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/236727-melt-in-your-mouth-slow-cooker-chicken-VAT-step-03-15335c5b8c5b459e81ed6da356b912b5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/236727/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook on Low for 6 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1Ih9SgXnLA5GpH5iDrUT21SB6ok=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/236727-melt-in-your-mouth-slow-cooker-chicken-VAT-step-04-163588c124da471f83f276519ea28ce1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/236727/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Shred chicken into chunks in the slow cooker using 2 forks. Stir in sour cream until just heated through.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xX33U7RpIT68GnVwD8SvNpj-j6o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/236727-melt-in-your-mouth-slow-cooker-chicken-VAT-step-05-310afd8fca614b3bbe68fbce152604a8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/236727/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Cook angel hair in the boiling water, stirring occasionally until cooked through but firm to the bite, 4 to 5 minutes. Drain.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6tgVcYGc5yudV-Sdf52fK_tmj3U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/236727-melt-in-your-mouth-slow-cooker-chicken-VAT-step-06-beb1069f9e34482cab02d284950ce754.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/236727/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve chicken and sauce over angel hair pasta.",
